      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Once human and now something apart, fetchlings display the Netherworld's ancient influence through monochrome complexions, glowing eyes, and the casting of supernatural shadows. These lithe and shadowy beings seem to sink and vanish into the gloom. They see in darkness, exercise control over shadows, and have strange occult powers. Some fetchlings develop their powers enough to pass between the Netherworld and the Universe, leaving other ancestries to whisper about figures that emerge from shaded corners and then vanish without a trace. Through magic and other means, they've spread across Golarion and the planes beyond, as adaptable as the humans they once were.",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          }
        ]
      },
